sketchBlocks.bodyMarkdown:
A mobile-first stylesheet makes the default rules usable in constrained space. Wider layouts are enhancements rather than prerequisites.

**Worked example:**

```css
main {
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
}
```

**Line by line:** `main {` targets the existing Grid container. `grid-template-columns: 1fr;` makes one flexible column the default layout, which works naturally at narrow widths. The closing `}` ends the base rule. No media query is needed for this narrow-screen default.

